1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,218
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Eng so‘nggi yangiliklardan qiziqarli mavzularni tanlab olamiz.

2
00:00:09,218 --> 00:00:10,718
1-qism: Bepul gid xizmatining taqdimoti / Bepul gid sayohatlar haqida

3
00:00:10,718 --> 00:00:13,931
Ertalabki yangiliklarni ko‘rdingizmi?

4
00:00:13,955 --> 00:00:17,404
Yo‘q, ko‘rmadim.

5
00:00:17,427 --> 00:00:20,660
Bepul gid xizmati haqida yangilik.

6
00:00:20,683 --> 00:00:23,617
Bepul gidmi?

7
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:26,106
Qanday gid?

8
00:00:26,129 --> 00:00:30,666
Shahar aholisi bepul gidlik qiladi.

9
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:33,779
Bepul gidlikmi?

10
00:00:33,802 --> 00:00:36,369
Ajoyib ekan!

11
00:00:36,392 --> 00:00:39,396
Ingliz tilidagi gidlar ham bormi?

12
00:00:39,419 --> 00:00:45,077
Ha, ingliz va xitoy tillarida gidlar bor.

13
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:48,272
Pul to‘lash kerakmi, ya’ni 0 yenmi?

14
00:00:48,295 --> 00:00:53,229
Ha, gid xizmati uchun pul to‘lash shart emas.

15
00:00:53,252 --> 00:00:56,052
Boshqa to‘lovlar bormi?

16
00:00:56,075 --> 00:01:01,041
Faqat elektr poyezdi va kirish uchun pul to‘lash kerak.

17
00:01:01,064 --> 00:01:04,113
Bu juda mashhur ekan!

18
00:01:04,137 --> 00:01:06,915
Qayerda band qilsam bo‘ladi?

19
00:01:06,938 --> 00:01:10,916
Axborot markazi yoki internet orqali band qilishingiz mumkin.

20
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:13,743
Bugun darhol band qilsam bo‘ladimi?

21
00:01:13,766 --> 00:01:17,199
Borishdan oldin band qilib qo‘ying.

22
00:01:17,222 --> 00:01:21,189
Asakusa yoki Imperator saroyida ham bormi?

23
00:01:21,212 --> 00:01:26,504
Ha, Asakusa va Imperator saroyida ham bor.

24
00:01:26,527 --> 00:01:29,727
Qanday ma’lumotlar eshitishim mumkin?

25
00:01:29,750 --> 00:01:34,035
Tarix va binolar haqida hikoyalar eshitishingiz mumkin.

26
00:01:34,059 --> 00:01:37,192
Yaxshi joylarni ham tavsiya qilishadi.

27
00:01:37,215 --> 00:01:40,582
Shahar aholisi bilan suhbatlashish imkoniyati ham bor.

28
00:01:40,605 --> 00:01:42,571
Juda xursand bo‘ldim!

29
00:01:42,594 --> 00:01:46,328
Mazali ovqatlanish joylarini ham ko‘rsatib berishadi.

30
00:01:46,351 --> 00:01:48,802
Madaniyat haqida ham ma’lumot olasiz.

31
00:01:48,825 --> 00:01:51,684
Bir safar necha soat davom etadi?

32
00:01:51,707 --> 00:01:55,841
1 soatdan 2 soatgacha davom etadi.

33
00:01:55,864 --> 00:01:59,275
Rasm ham olish imkoniyati bor.

34
00:01:59,298 --> 00:02:01,531
Aynan mos vaqt ekan.

35
00:02:01,554 --> 00:02:04,821
Shu hafta oxirida band qilaman.

36
00:02:04,844 --> 00:02:08,377
Internetda ismingizni yozib qo‘ying.

37
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:11,697
Ingliz tilidagi gid yaxshi bo‘ladi.

38
00:02:11,721 --> 00:02:15,954
Til bo‘limida ingliz tilini tanlang.

39
00:02:15,977 --> 00:02:18,666
Elektron pochta keladimi?

40
00:02:18,689 --> 00:02:22,903
Ha, uchrashish joyi haqida elektron pochta keladi.

41
00:02:22,927 --> 00:02:25,894
Pochtani ko‘rib boraman.

42
00:02:25,917 --> 00:02:28,974
Yangiliklar uchun rahmat.

43
00:02:28,997 --> 00:02:31,770
Yaxshi sayohat qiling!

44
00:02:31,794 --> 00:02:40,803
Bugungi videoning skripti tavsif qismida va eng yuqori kommentariyadan yuklab olishingiz mumkin. Yuklab olishdan oldin izoh qoldirishni unutmang.

45
00:02:40,803 --> 00:02:42,303
2-qism: Bepul ingliz gidini band qilish / Bepul ingliz gidini band qilish

46
00:02:42,303 --> 00:02:44,073
Uzr, menga yordam kerak.

47
00:02:44,096 --> 00:02:48,916
Bepul ingliz gidini band qilmoqchiman.

48
00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:50,606
Xush kelibsiz!

49
00:02:50,629 --> 00:02:53,034
Gid xizmatlari qabulxonasi.

50
00:02:53,058 --> 00:02:56,748
Ertangi ertalab sayohat mavjudmi?

51
00:02:56,771 --> 00:02:58,238
Ҳа.

52
00:02:58,261 --> 00:03:02,140
Эртага соат 10:00 да экскурсия бўлади.

53
00:03:02,163 --> 00:03:05,196
Қайерни кўрсатамиз?

54
00:03:05,219 --> 00:03:08,886
Асакуса кўчаси ва Асакуса иbodatхонаси.

55
00:03:08,909 --> 00:03:11,709
Неча соатлик экскурсия?

56
00:03:11,732 --> 00:03:14,265
Тахминан икки соат.

57
00:03:14,288 --> 00:03:16,925
Гид инглизча гапирадими?

58
00:03:16,949 --> 00:03:18,482
Ҳа.

59
00:03:18,505 --> 00:03:20,972
Инглизча гапира оладиган киши.

60
00:03:20,995 --> 00:03:24,533
Гид учун пул тўлаш шартми?

61
00:03:24,556 --> 00:03:25,889
Ҳа.

62
00:03:25,912 --> 00:03:28,048
Бекор, текин.

63
00:03:28,072 --> 00:03:30,115
Juda xursand bo‘ldim!

64
00:03:30,138 --> 00:03:34,230
Фақат электричка ва кириш учун пул тўласангиз бўлади.

65
00:03:34,254 --> 00:03:36,287
Тушunarлим.

66
00:03:36,310 --> 00:03:38,512
Икки киши борамиз.

67
00:03:38,536 --> 00:03:41,411
Қоғозга исмингизни ёзинг.

68
00:03:41,435 --> 00:03:45,568
Исмимни ва дўстимни исмини ёзаман.

69
00:03:45,591 --> 00:03:48,424
Меҳмонхона номини ҳам ёзинг.

70
00:03:48,447 --> 00:03:51,332
Меҳмонхона номини ёздим.

71
00:03:51,355 --> 00:03:53,235
Тасдиқладим.

72
00:03:53,258 --> 00:03:55,125
Раҳмат.

73
00:03:55,148 --> 00:03:58,916
Эртага қayerда тўплашамиз?

74
00:03:58,939 --> 00:04:03,873
Эртага соат 9:50 да қизил байроқ олдига келинг.

75
00:04:03,896 --> 00:04:06,062
Қизил байроқ, шуни.

76
00:04:06,085 --> 00:04:07,862
Тушunarлим.

77
00:04:07,886 --> 00:04:11,302
Гид плакат кўтариб турибди.

78
00:04:11,326 --> 00:04:13,693
Спорт пойабзал билан борайликми?

79
00:04:13,716 --> 00:04:15,082
Ҳа.

80
00:04:15,105 --> 00:04:17,872
Юришга қулай бўлган пойабзал кийиб келинг.

81
00:04:17,895 --> 00:04:20,895
Сув ва шляпа ҳам оламан.

82
00:04:20,918 --> 00:04:24,566
Иссиқ, шунинг учун сув ичиб туринг.

83
00:04:24,589 --> 00:04:28,163
Расм ҳам олиб бериш мумкинми?

84
00:04:28,187 --> 00:04:29,557
Ҳа.

85
00:04:29,580 --> 00:04:32,747
Гид кўп расм олади.

86
00:04:32,770 --> 00:04:35,807
Тарих ҳақида эшитиш жуда қизиқ.

87
00:04:35,830 --> 00:04:39,066
Жуда қизиқарли тарихларни билиб оласиз.

88
00:04:39,089 --> 00:04:41,823
Мазали овқатлар сотиладиган жойларни ҳам биламан десам?

89
00:04:41,846 --> 00:04:45,279
Гид сизга рамэн дўкони ҳам кўрсатади.

90
00:04:45,302 --> 00:04:48,035
Бирор қоғоз олиб қўйишим мумкинми?

91
00:04:48,058 --> 00:04:49,492
Ҳа.

92
00:04:49,516 --> 00:04:51,994
Сизга йўл кўрсаткич қоғоз берамиз.

93
00:04:52,018 --> 00:04:54,664
Қоғозни эътибор билан сақлайман.

94
00:04:54,688 --> 00:04:57,984
Эртага соат 9:50 да кутамиз.

95
00:04:58,007 --> 00:04:59,774
Катта раҳмат.

96
00:04:59,797 --> 00:05:01,763
Кутамиз.

97
00:05:01,786 --> 00:05:08,891
Бугунги видеодаги мавзуни такрорлаш учун сайтга ҳавола tavsifi va eng yuqori комментарийда бор. *Сайт олдиндан огоҳланмасдан ўчирилиши мумкин.

98
00:05:08,891 --> 00:05:10,391
3-Саҳна: Кочish учун рўйхатдан ўтиш / Koʻchishni roʻyxatdan oʻtkazish

99
00:05:10,391 --> 00:05:12,325
Uzr, menga yordam kerak.

100
00:05:12,348 --> 00:05:15,840
Кочish учун рўйхатдан ўтмоқчиман.

101
00:05:15,864 --> 00:05:17,000
Ҳа.

102
00:05:17,023 --> 00:05:19,714
Бу ёндаги ойнага мурожаат қилинг.

103
00:05:19,738 --> 00:05:23,105
Янги шаҳарга кўчиб келдим.

104
00:05:23,128 --> 00:05:27,867
Бу қоғозга янги манзилингизни ёзинг.

105
00:05:27,891 --> 00:05:30,373
Канжида ёзаманми?

106
00:05:30,397 --> 00:05:33,930
Канжи ва катаканада ёзинг.

107
00:05:33,953 --> 00:05:36,720
Хона рақамини ҳам ёзаманми?

108
00:05:36,743 --> 00:05:38,310
Ҳа.

109
00:05:38,333 --> 00:05:41,145
Хона рақамини ҳам ёзинг.

110
00:05:41,168 --> 00:05:44,137
Кўчган кунни ҳам ёзаманми?

111
00:05:44,161 --> 00:05:45,656
Ҳа.

112
00:05:45,679 --> 00:05:50,287
Yangi uyga koʻchgan kuningizni yozing.

113
00:05:50,311 --> 00:05:53,362
20-iyul deb yozdim.

114
00:05:53,386 --> 00:05:56,453
Oldingi shahardagi hujjatlaringiz bormi?

115
00:05:56,476 --> 00:05:57,769
Ҳа.

116
00:05:57,793 --> 00:06:01,861
Oldingi shahardagi hujjatlar va yashash kartam bor.

117
00:06:01,885 --> 00:06:04,724
Hujjatlar va kartani olaman.

118
00:06:04,747 --> 00:06:09,347
Yashash kartasining orqa tomoniga yangi manzilni yozaymi?

119
00:06:09,370 --> 00:06:10,838
Ҳа.

120
00:06:10,862 --> 00:06:14,228
Bu yerda yangi manzilni yozamiz.

121
00:06:14,251 --> 00:06:18,785
Mening raqamli shaxsiy identifikatsiya kartam (MY NUMBER) manzilini ham oʻzgartirish kerakmi?

122
00:06:18,807 --> 00:06:20,249
Ҳа.

123
00:06:20,273 --> 00:06:22,207
Birga oʻzgartiramiz.

124
00:06:22,230 --> 00:06:24,630
Kartani bering.

125
00:06:24,653 --> 00:06:27,086
Parolni kiritamanmi?

126
00:06:27,109 --> 00:06:30,842
Toʻrt xonali raqamli parolni kiriting.

127
00:06:30,865 --> 00:06:33,232
Parolni kiritdim.

128
00:06:33,255 --> 00:06:36,455
Karta yangilandi.

129
00:06:36,478 --> 00:06:39,811
Manzil haqidagi hujjatni olishim mumkinmi?

130
00:06:39,834 --> 00:06:41,401
Ҳа.

131
00:06:41,425 --> 00:06:43,898
Manzil haqidagi hujjatni beraman.

132
00:06:43,921 --> 00:06:46,288
Bir dona qancha turadi?

133
00:06:46,311 --> 00:06:49,121
Bir dona 300 yendan.

134
00:06:49,144 --> 00:06:51,077
Ikki dona bering.

135
00:06:51,100 --> 00:06:53,903
Ikki dona 600 yendan.

136
00:06:53,927 --> 00:06:56,802
Naqd 600 yen beraman.

137
00:06:56,826 --> 00:06:59,764
Ikki dona hujjatni beraman.

138
00:06:59,787 --> 00:07:01,320
Раҳмат.

139
00:07:01,343 --> 00:07:04,177
Axlat toʻplash boʻyicha kitobni ham beraman.

140
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:07,298
Inglizcha kitob olishim mumkinmi?

141
00:07:07,321 --> 00:07:08,755
Ҳа.

142
00:07:08,778 --> 00:07:11,111
Inglizcha kitobni oling.

143
00:07:11,134 --> 00:07:13,414
Qaysi kun chiqarib tashlashni koʻring.

144
00:07:13,437 --> 00:07:16,171
Qaysi kun chiqarib tashlashni tekshirib qoʻying.

145
00:07:16,194 --> 00:07:18,827
Maʼlumot berganingiz uchun rahmat.

146
00:07:18,850 --> 00:07:22,326
Yangi hayotingizdan zavqlaning!

147
00:07:22,349 --> 00:07:23,849
4-Sahna: MY NUMBER kartani olish tartibi

148
00:07:23,849 --> 00:07:26,016
Uzr, menga yordam kerak.

149
00:07:26,039 --> 00:07:29,442
MY NUMBER kartani olishni istardim.

150
00:07:29,465 --> 00:07:32,032
Karta berish boʻlimiga boring.

151
00:07:32,055 --> 00:07:34,730
Pushti rangli xat keldi.

152
00:07:34,753 --> 00:07:36,820
Xatni olaman.

153
00:07:36,843 --> 00:07:39,488
Yashash kartangiz bormi?

154
00:07:39,511 --> 00:07:42,678
Yashash kartam va pasportim bor.

155
00:07:42,701 --> 00:07:44,308
Koʻrib chiqdim.

156
00:07:44,331 --> 00:07:45,944
Muammosiz.

157
00:07:45,967 --> 00:07:49,167
Xatning orqa tomoniga ismimni yozdim.

158
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,969
Раҳмат.

159
00:07:50,993 --> 00:07:53,726
Parolni belgilaymizmi?

160
00:07:53,749 --> 00:07:54,818
Ҳа.

161
00:07:54,842 --> 00:07:57,242
Parolni belgilang.

162
00:07:57,265 --> 00:08:00,065
Necha xil parol kerak boʻladi?

163
00:08:00,088 --> 00:08:05,254
Toʻrt xonali raqam va harf-raqamli parol kerak boʻladi.

164
00:08:05,277 --> 00:08:09,089
Toʻrt xonali raqam konbini (doʻkonda) ishlatadimi?

165
00:08:09,113 --> 00:08:10,086
Ҳа.

166
00:08:10,109 --> 00:08:14,243
Konbini (doʻkonda) manzil haqidagi hujjat olishda ishlatiladi.

167
00:08:14,266 --> 00:08:17,068
Toʻrt xonali raqamni kiritaman.

168
00:08:17,091 --> 00:08:19,110
Ekran orqali kiriting.

169
00:08:19,133 --> 00:08:20,700
Kiritdim.

170
00:08:20,723 --> 00:08:23,798
Keyin uzunroq parolni kiritamiz.

171
00:08:23,821 --> 00:08:25,056
Ҳа.

172
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:27,715
Harflar va raqamlarni kiriting.

173
00:08:27,739 --> 00:08:29,911
Parolni kiritdim.

174
00:08:29,934 --> 00:08:31,934
Tugadi.

175
00:08:31,957 --> 00:08:33,690
Eslatmaga yozaman.

176
00:08:33,713 --> 00:08:36,480
Ehtiyotkorlik bilan saqlang, iltimos.

177
00:08:36,503 --> 00:08:38,750
Karta qachongacha amal qiladi?

178
00:08:38,773 --> 00:08:44,251
Yashash kartasi bilan bir xil muddatda.

179
00:08:44,275 --> 00:08:46,242
Yashash kartangiz yangilansa, nima qilasiz?

180
00:08:46,265 --> 00:08:48,832
Bu kartani ham yangilaymiz.

181
00:08:48,855 --> 00:08:52,988
Oʻsha paytda tuman idorasiga kelishim kerakmi?

182
00:08:53,011 --> 00:08:54,186
Ҳа.

183
00:08:54,209 --> 00:08:56,083
Keling, iltimos.

184
00:08:56,107 --> 00:08:57,574
Тушunarлим.

185
00:08:57,597 --> 00:09:00,637
Yuzingizni tekshirishni oxirida qilamiz.

186
00:09:00,660 --> 00:09:03,060
Maskani yechaymi?

187
00:09:03,083 --> 00:09:04,250
Ҳа.

188
00:09:04,273 --> 00:09:08,106
Kameraga qarang, iltimos, maskani yeching.

189
00:09:08,129 --> 00:09:09,701
Yechdim.

190
00:09:09,724 --> 00:09:11,024
Ҳа.

191
00:09:11,047 --> 00:09:12,714
Tasdiqlandi.

192
00:09:12,737 --> 00:09:14,782
Kartani topshiraman.

193
00:09:14,805 --> 00:09:16,810
Kartani oldim.

194
00:09:16,834 --> 00:09:19,967
Bu karta kasalxonada ham ishlatiladi.

195
00:09:19,991 --> 00:09:22,563
Kasalxonada foydalanishingiz mumkin.

196
00:09:22,587 --> 00:09:24,191
Qulay ekan!

197
00:09:24,214 --> 00:09:26,427
Ilova (dastur)dan ham foydalaning.

198
00:09:26,450 --> 00:09:28,817
Ilovani oʻrnataman.

199
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:31,718
Yoʻqolsa, qoʻngʻiroq qiling.

200
00:09:31,742 --> 00:09:33,624
Hamyonimga solaman.

201
00:09:33,648 --> 00:09:35,983
Катта раҳмат.

202
00:09:36,006 --> 00:09:37,506
5-sahna: Yapon tili darsligiga kirish

203
00:09:37,506 --> 00:09:39,483
Uzr, menga yordam kerak.

204
00:09:39,506 --> 00:09:43,673
Yapon tili darsligi haqida maʼlumot bering.

205
00:09:43,696 --> 00:09:44,786
Xa,

206
00:09:44,810 --> 00:09:48,223
Yapon tili darsligi haqida maʼlumot.

207
00:09:48,246 --> 00:09:53,057
Bu yerda yapon tilini oʻrganishim mumkinmi?

208
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,366
Xa,

209
00:09:54,389 --> 00:09:58,127
Har shanba kuni oʻtkaziladi.

210
00:09:58,151 --> 00:10:00,888
Soat nechadan boshlanadi?

211
00:10:00,911 --> 00:10:05,550
Ertalab soat 10 dan 11:30 gacha.

212
00:10:05,574 --> 00:10:08,040
Pul qancha turadi?

213
00:10:08,063 --> 00:10:10,997
Pul bepul.

214
00:10:11,020 --> 00:10:12,864
Bepulmi?

215
00:10:12,887 --> 00:10:14,978
Juda xursand bo‘ldim!

216
00:10:15,001 --> 00:10:19,614
Darslik uchun faqat 500 yen.

217
00:10:19,637 --> 00:10:21,448
500 yen, shundaymi?

218
00:10:21,471 --> 00:10:24,205
Qanday darslik?

219
00:10:24,228 --> 00:10:29,233
Boshlangʻichlar uchun N5 darajasidagi darslik.

220
00:10:29,256 --> 00:10:33,056
Xiraganadan boshlab oʻrganish mumkinmi?

221
00:10:33,079 --> 00:10:34,957
Xa,

222
00:10:34,981 --> 00:10:37,648
Xiraganadan boshlab oʻrgatamiz.

223
00:10:37,671 --> 00:10:40,568
Oʻqituvchi koʻngilli (volonter)mi?

224
00:10:40,591 --> 00:10:42,524
Xa,

225
00:10:42,547 --> 00:10:45,914
Mehribon koʻngilli oʻqituvchilar.

226
00:10:45,937 --> 00:10:48,504
Oʻqituvchi bir kishi mi?

227
00:10:48,527 --> 00:10:53,368
Ikki talabaga bitta oʻqituvchi.

228
00:10:53,391 --> 00:10:56,027
Savol berish mumkin, yaxshi ekan!

229
00:10:56,050 --> 00:10:59,858
Gapirish mashgʻulotini koʻp qilish mumkin.

230
00:10:59,882 --> 00:11:02,759
Bolalar bilan birga kelishim mumkinmi?

231
00:11:02,782 --> 00:11:04,516
Xa,

232
00:11:04,539 --> 00:11:07,432
Bolalar uchun oʻyin joyi bor.

233
00:11:07,455 --> 00:11:10,501
Xotirjamlik bilan kelishingiz mumkin.

234
00:11:10,525 --> 00:11:14,006
Darsni koʻrish ham mumkin.

235
00:11:14,029 --> 00:11:16,432
Shanba kuni koʻrmoqchiman.

236
00:11:16,456 --> 00:11:19,462
Istalgan vaqtda koʻrishingiz mumkin.

237
00:11:19,486 --> 00:11:23,381
Shu hafta shanba kuni soat 10 da kelaman.

238
00:11:23,404 --> 00:11:28,138
Soat 9:45 da kassaga keling.

239
00:11:28,161 --> 00:11:30,235
Ism yozasizmi?

240
00:11:30,258 --> 00:11:31,825
Xa,

241
00:11:31,848 --> 00:11:36,621
Bu qogʻozga ism va telefon raqamingizni yozing.

242
00:11:36,645 --> 00:11:39,616
Ism va telefon raqamini, shundaymi?

243
00:11:39,639 --> 00:11:41,806
Yozib boʻldim.

244
00:11:41,829 --> 00:11:43,429
Катта раҳмат.

245
00:11:43,452 --> 00:11:46,629
Sinfxonaga borishni intiqlik bilan kutmoqdaman.

246
00:11:46,652 --> 00:11:50,019
Yapon tilini qiziqarli oʻrganamiz.

247
00:11:50,042 --> 00:11:53,209
Doʻstlarim bilan birga borsam boʻladi mi?

248
00:11:53,233 --> 00:11:54,866
Xa,

249
00:11:54,889 --> 00:11:57,184
Doʻstlaringiz bilan keling.

250
00:11:57,208 --> 00:11:58,902
Катта раҳмат.

251
00:11:58,925 --> 00:12:02,658
Shanba kuni sizni kutamiz.

252
00:12:02,681 --> 00:12:03,681
Xa,

253
00:12:03,704 --> 00:12:05,985
Shanba kuni boraman.

254
00:12:06,009 --> 00:12:07,862
Xayr.

255
00:12:07,885 --> 00:12:09,385
6-SAHNA: Shinkansenda yuk bron qilish qoidalari

256
00:12:09,385 --> 00:12:12,919
Ertalabki yangiliklarni ko‘rdingizmi?

257
00:12:12,942 --> 00:12:16,075
Yo‘q, ko‘rmadim.

258
00:12:16,098 --> 00:12:20,331
Shinkansendagi katta yuklar haqida yangilik.

259
00:12:20,354 --> 00:12:22,888
Qanday yangilik?

260
00:12:22,911 --> 00:12:27,890
Katta chamadonlar uchun bron qilish kerak.

261
00:12:27,913 --> 00:12:31,331
Minishdan oldin bron qilasizmi?

262
00:12:31,355 --> 00:12:34,767
Ha, bron qilish kerak.

263
00:12:34,790 --> 00:12:39,023
Bron qilishni unutganimda nima boʻladi?

264
00:12:39,046 --> 00:12:41,980
1000 yen toʻlashingiz kerak boʻladi.

265
00:12:42,003 --> 00:12:45,010
1000 yen qimmat ekan-ku.

266
00:12:45,033 --> 00:12:48,600
Ha, ehtiyot boʻling.

267
00:12:48,624 --> 00:12:51,500
Qayerda bron qilish mumkin?

268
00:12:51,524 --> 00:12:54,800
Kassada bron qilish mumkin.

269
00:12:54,823 --> 00:12:59,057
Chipta avtomatidan ham bron qilish mumkinmi?

270
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:03,564
Ha, chipta avtomatidan ham bron qilish mumkin.

271
00:13:03,587 --> 00:13:06,220
Internet orqali ham mumkinmi?

272
00:13:06,243 --> 00:13:10,510
Ha, smartfon orqali ham bron qilish mumkin.

273
00:13:10,533 --> 00:13:13,699
Yukni qayerga qoʻyish kerak?

274
00:13:13,722 --> 00:13:17,335
Oxirgi oʻrindiqning orqasiga qoʻying.

275
00:13:17,359 --> 00:13:21,126
Katta yuk uchun moʻljallangan oʻrindiqmi?

276
00:13:21,149 --> 00:13:24,715
Ha, shu oʻrindiq.

277
00:13:24,738 --> 00:13:28,472
Shu oʻrindiq uchun qoʻshimcha pul toʻlash kerakmi?

278
00:13:28,495 --> 00:13:31,380
Yoʻq, bepul.

279
00:13:31,403 --> 00:13:35,136
Bepulmi? Yaxshi ekan.

280
00:13:35,159 --> 00:13:38,036
Erkin oʻrindiqlar haqida nima deyish mumkin?

281
00:13:38,060 --> 00:13:40,894
Erkin oʻrindiqlarda mumkin emas.

282
00:13:40,917 --> 00:13:44,574
Unda, men belgilangan oʻrindiq sotib olaman.

283
00:13:44,597 --> 00:13:47,997
Ha, belgilangan oʻrindiq sotib oling.

284
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:52,687
Uyda oʻz yukimning hajmini oʻlchayman.

285
00:13:52,710 --> 00:13:56,889
160 santimetrgacha bron qilish shart emas.

286
00:13:56,913 --> 00:14:01,480
Shunda ustki javonga qoʻyaman.

287
00:14:01,503 --> 00:14:04,240
Ha, ustki javonga qoʻying.

288
00:14:04,263 --> 00:14:05,946
Tushunarli.

289
00:14:05,969 --> 00:14:07,836
Yaxshi boʻldi.

290
00:14:07,859 --> 00:14:09,592
Ehtiyot boʻlaman.

291
00:14:09,615 --> 00:14:12,817
Sayohatingizdan zavqlaning!

292
00:14:12,841 --> 00:14:14,848
Раҳмат.

293
00:14:14,872 --> 00:14:16,605
Ketyapman.

294
00:14:16,628 --> 00:14:18,862
Xayr, yo'l bo'ling!

295
00:14:18,885 --> 00:14:20,385
Sahna 7: Chipta sotib olish / Poyezd chiptasini qanday sotib olish kerak

296
00:14:20,385 --> 00:14:22,060
Uzr, menga yordam kerak.

297
00:14:22,083 --> 00:14:24,725
Chipta sotib olmoqchiman.

298
00:14:24,748 --> 00:14:26,382
Xush kelibsiz!

299
00:14:26,405 --> 00:14:28,771
Qayergacha borasiz?

300
00:14:28,794 --> 00:14:32,165
Tokiodan Kiotogacha boraman.

301
00:14:32,189 --> 00:14:34,756
Bugun soat nechada poyezdi?

302
00:14:34,779 --> 00:14:38,312
Soat 10 da poyezdni iltimos qilaman.

303
00:14:38,335 --> 00:14:39,902
Ҳа.

304
00:14:39,925 --> 00:14:43,613
10:07 da 'Nozomi' poyezdi bor.

305
00:14:43,636 --> 00:14:45,836
Kattalar ikki kishi.

306
00:14:45,859 --> 00:14:47,293
Ҳа.

307
00:14:47,316 --> 00:14:48,920
Belgilangan o'rindiq, shundaymi?

308
00:14:48,943 --> 00:14:52,677
Katta chamadonlarimiz ikki dona bor.

309
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:56,833
Yukingiz 160 santimetrdan katta mi?

310
00:14:56,856 --> 00:14:58,223
Ҳа.

311
00:14:58,246 --> 00:15:01,012
180 santimetr bor.

312
00:15:01,035 --> 00:15:04,878
Shunda katta yuk uchun joy ajratamiz.

313
00:15:04,902 --> 00:15:07,573
Bu joy qanday joy?

314
00:15:07,597 --> 00:15:10,453
Oxirgi qator o'rindiq.

315
00:15:10,476 --> 00:15:14,076
O'rindiq ortiga yukni qo'yasiz.

316
00:15:14,099 --> 00:15:16,739
Ko'proq pul to'lash kerakmi?

317
00:15:16,762 --> 00:15:19,647
Yo'q, bir xil narxda.

318
00:15:19,671 --> 00:15:21,748
Bir xil narxda ekanmi?

319
00:15:21,772 --> 00:15:23,779
Juda xursand bo‘ldim!

320
00:15:23,802 --> 00:15:26,936
D va E o'rindiqlarini ajratamiz.

321
00:15:26,959 --> 00:15:29,374
Ikki o'rindiq yonma-yon.

322
00:15:29,397 --> 00:15:32,335
Derazaga yaqin o'rindiq yaxshi bo'lardi.

323
00:15:32,358 --> 00:15:35,170
E o'rindiq derazaga yaqin.

324
00:15:35,193 --> 00:15:38,281
Shu o'rindiqni iltimos qilaman.

325
00:15:38,305 --> 00:15:41,472
Bir kishiga 14 000 yen.

326
00:15:41,495 --> 00:15:44,392
Ikki kishiga 28 000 yen, shundaymi?

327
00:15:44,416 --> 00:15:45,709
Ҳа.

328
00:15:45,732 --> 00:15:48,299
28 000 yen.

329
00:15:48,322 --> 00:15:50,289
Karta bilan to'layman.

330
00:15:50,312 --> 00:15:53,602
Kartani shu yerga teging.

331
00:15:53,625 --> 00:15:54,825
Ҳа.

332
00:15:54,848 --> 00:15:57,421
To'rtta chipta chiqadi.

333
00:15:57,445 --> 00:15:59,582
Bir kishiga ikki dona, shundaymi?

334
00:15:59,605 --> 00:16:00,901
Ҳа.

335
00:16:00,924 --> 00:16:04,339
Ikkita chiptani birga tekshirish joyiga soling.

336
00:16:04,363 --> 00:16:05,999
Тушunarлим.

337
00:16:06,022 --> 00:16:07,869
Ikkita solaman.

338
00:16:07,893 --> 00:16:11,362
Poyezd 16-platformadan jo'naydi.

339
00:16:11,386 --> 00:16:14,031
Yukni qayerga qoʻyish kerak?

340
00:16:14,054 --> 00:16:17,288
O'z o'rindiqizning ortiga qo'ying.

341
00:16:17,311 --> 00:16:18,444
Ҳа.

342
00:16:18,467 --> 00:16:20,555
Ortiga qo'yaman.

343
00:16:20,579 --> 00:16:24,184
Yukingizga o'z ismingizni yozib qo'ying.

344
00:16:24,207 --> 00:16:25,374
Ҳа.

345
00:16:25,397 --> 00:16:27,771
Ism qog'ozini yopishtiraman.

346
00:16:27,794 --> 00:16:29,761
Bu bilan hammasi tugadi.

347
00:16:29,784 --> 00:16:31,451
Катта раҳмат.

348
00:16:31,474 --> 00:16:34,147
Yaxshi sayohat tilayman!

349
00:16:34,171 --> 00:16:35,671
Sahna 8: Chipta vaqtini o'zgartirish / Poyezd chiptasi vaqtini qanday o'zgartirish kerak

350
00:16:35,671 --> 00:16:41,004
Uzr, chipta vaqtini o'zgartirmoqchiman.

351
00:16:41,027 --> 00:16:45,106
Ha, u mashinada qilishingiz mumkin.

352
00:16:45,130 --> 00:16:50,263
Ekrandagi English tugmasini bosaman.

353
00:16:50,286 --> 00:16:53,890
Ha, inglizcha ekran chiqadi.

354
00:16:53,914 --> 00:16:57,767
Vaqtni o'zgartirish tugmasini bosing.

355
00:16:57,791 --> 00:17:03,087
Ha. Keyin, bor chiptangizni soling.

356
00:17:03,110 --> 00:17:05,977
Shu yerga solaman.

357
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:09,538
Ha, chipta joylandi.

358
00:17:09,561 --> 00:17:14,596
Soat 11:00 poyezdi oʻrniga 12:00 poyezdga oʻzgartiramiz.

359
00:17:14,619 --> 00:17:17,597
Birinchi marta bepul.

360
00:17:17,621 --> 00:17:19,387
Bepulmi?

361
00:17:19,410 --> 00:17:21,777
Juda xursand bo‘ldim!

362
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:25,210
Soat 12:00 poyezdni tanlang.

363
00:17:25,233 --> 00:17:29,636
Soat 12:05 da ketadigan Nozomi poyezdini tanlayman.

364
00:17:29,659 --> 00:17:32,798
Katta yukingiz bormi?

365
00:17:32,822 --> 00:17:37,316
Ha, juda katta yukim bor.

366
00:17:37,339 --> 00:17:42,106
Katta yuk uchun joy belgilash tugmasini bosing.

367
00:17:42,129 --> 00:17:44,781
Ha, bosdim.

368
00:17:44,804 --> 00:17:50,804
Oxirgi qatorning 15D va 15E joylari boʻsh.

369
00:17:50,827 --> 00:17:54,760
15D va 15E joylarini tanlayman.

370
00:17:54,783 --> 00:17:58,021
Yukni orqaga qoʻyish uchun joylar, shundaymi?

371
00:17:58,045 --> 00:18:01,479
Tasdiqlash tugmasini bosing.

372
00:18:01,501 --> 00:18:03,068
Bosdim.

373
00:18:03,091 --> 00:18:05,986
Pul toʻlash kerakmi?

374
00:18:06,010 --> 00:18:09,029
Yoʻq, toʻlash shart emas.

375
00:18:09,052 --> 00:18:11,185
Yaxshi boʻldi.

376
00:18:11,208 --> 00:18:14,475
Yangi chipta chiqadi endi.

377
00:18:14,498 --> 00:18:16,665
Chipta chiqdi.

378
00:18:16,688 --> 00:18:20,654
Eski chiptani mashinaga soling.

379
00:18:20,677 --> 00:18:26,811
Yangi chiptada katta yuk deb yozilgan.

380
00:18:26,834 --> 00:18:29,567
Toʻgʻri bajardingiz!

381
00:18:29,590 --> 00:18:33,323
Poyezd ketishiga hali bir soat bor.

382
00:18:33,346 --> 00:18:36,039
Kafeda dam oling.

383
00:18:36,062 --> 00:18:38,940
Choy olib kutaman.

384
00:18:38,964 --> 00:18:42,968
Poyezd 16-platformadan ketadi.

385
00:18:42,992 --> 00:18:46,562
Ha, 16-platformaga boraman.

386
00:18:46,586 --> 00:18:50,828
Yangi chiptani turniketga soling.

387
00:18:50,851 --> 00:18:52,823
Тушunarлим.

388
00:18:52,847 --> 00:18:58,013
15-joy orqasiga yukingizni qoʻying.

389
00:18:58,036 --> 00:19:00,674
Xa, eslab qolaman.

390
00:19:00,697 --> 00:19:03,180
Xayr, yaxshi boring!

391
00:19:03,204 --> 00:19:04,704
9-Sahna: Joydagi Yukni Joylashtirish / Oʻrindiq Yonida Yukni Qayerga Qoʻyish Kerak

392
00:19:04,704 --> 00:19:06,538
Uzr, menga yordam kerak.

393
00:19:06,562 --> 00:19:10,928
Katta yukni qayerga qoʻyish kerak?

394
00:19:10,951 --> 00:19:13,801
Joyingiz nechanchi raqamda?

395
00:19:13,825 --> 00:19:18,625
15-D va 15-E joylari.

396
00:19:18,648 --> 00:19:21,685
15-joy orqasida.

397
00:19:21,708 --> 00:19:24,515
Joy orqasida, shundaymi?

398
00:19:24,539 --> 00:19:25,872
Xa,

399
00:19:25,895 --> 00:19:29,179
U yerga chamadonni qoʻying.

400
00:19:29,203 --> 00:19:32,272
Ikki dona qoʻyish mumkinmi?

401
00:19:32,295 --> 00:19:33,582
Xa,

402
00:19:33,605 --> 00:19:36,438
Ha, ikki dona qoʻyishingiz mumkin.

403
00:19:36,461 --> 00:19:38,530
Yiqilmaydimi?

404
00:19:38,554 --> 00:19:41,032
Gʻildiraklarini toʻxtating.

405
00:19:41,055 --> 00:19:42,702
Toʻxtatdim.

406
00:19:42,726 --> 00:19:45,560
Endi xavfsiz, shundaymi?

407
00:19:45,583 --> 00:19:48,755
Yukingizga qulf qoʻyasizmi?

408
00:19:48,778 --> 00:19:52,218
Xavotir boʻlsa, qulf qoʻying.

409
00:19:52,242 --> 00:19:53,575
Xa,

410
00:19:53,598 --> 00:19:55,798
Qulfni qoʻyaman.

411
00:19:55,821 --> 00:19:59,754
Yukni qoʻyib boʻlgach, joyingizga oʻtiring.

412
00:19:59,777 --> 00:20:03,111
15D joyiga oʻtiraman.

413
00:20:03,134 --> 00:20:05,667
Yaxshi dam oling.

414
00:20:05,690 --> 00:20:09,490
Poyezdda Wi-Fi bormi?

415
00:20:09,513 --> 00:20:10,880
Xa,

416
00:20:10,903 --> 00:20:13,269
Bepul Wi-Fi mavjud.

417
00:20:13,292 --> 00:20:16,059
Smartfonimni ulayapman.

418
00:20:16,082 --> 00:20:19,649
Ekrandagi „Ha“ tugmasini bosing.

419
00:20:19,671 --> 00:20:22,647
Internetga ulandik.

420
00:20:22,670 --> 00:20:26,165
Oyoqlaringiz tagida rozetka ham bor.

421
00:20:26,188 --> 00:20:28,155
Zaryad qilyapman.

422
00:20:28,178 --> 00:20:29,611
Xa,

423
00:20:29,634 --> 00:20:32,034
Smartfoningizni zaryad qila olasiz.

424
00:20:32,057 --> 00:20:35,257
Bento sotuvchi keladimi?

425
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:38,882
Sotuvchi faqat yashil vagonda boʻladi.

426
00:20:38,906 --> 00:20:43,439
Bu oʻrindan bento sotib olish mumkinmi?

427
00:20:43,462 --> 00:20:46,829
Smartfon orqali buyurtma berish mumkin.

428
00:20:46,852 --> 00:20:50,885
Joyning oʻzidagi QR-koddan foydalanamiz.

429
00:20:50,908 --> 00:20:51,908
Xa,

430
00:20:51,931 --> 00:20:55,498
Muzqaymoq va kofe ham sotib olish mumkin.

431
00:20:55,521 --> 00:20:58,454
Muzqaymoq olaman.

432
00:20:58,477 --> 00:21:01,611
Bu Shinkansenning mazali muzqaymogʻi.

433
00:21:01,634 --> 00:21:03,671
Kutib turaman.

434
00:21:03,694 --> 00:21:07,111
Kyotoga yana 2 soat bor.

435
00:21:07,135 --> 00:21:09,501
Poyezd juda tinch ekan.

436
00:21:09,524 --> 00:21:12,658
Ishingiz tushsa, menga aytib qoʻying.

437
00:21:12,681 --> 00:21:14,361
Катта раҳмат.

438
00:21:14,384 --> 00:21:17,078
Yaxshi sayohat tilayman!

439
00:21:17,102 --> 00:21:18,602
10-sahna: Katta yuklarni bron qilish va toʻlovlar

440
00:21:18,602 --> 00:21:23,735
Kechirasiz, chamadonimni qoʻyish joyini bilmayapman.

441
00:21:23,758 --> 00:21:26,292
Chiptangizni koʻrsatib qoʻying.

442
00:21:26,315 --> 00:21:30,281
8-vagonning 10A oʻrindigʻi.

443
00:21:30,304 --> 00:21:33,104
Bu juda katta chamadon ekan.

444
00:21:33,127 --> 00:21:36,460
Ha, 180 santimetr bor.

445
00:21:36,483 --> 00:21:41,735
160 santimetrdan katta yuklar „katta yuk“ deb ataladi.

446
00:21:41,759 --> 00:21:45,765
Minishdan oldin bron qilish kerak edi, shundaymi?

447
00:21:45,788 --> 00:21:49,365
Ha, bron qilish kerak.

448
00:21:49,388 --> 00:21:52,221
Bron qilishni unutibman.

449
00:21:52,244 --> 00:21:56,702
Bron qilinmagan boʻlsa, qoʻshimcha pul toʻlash kerak boʻladi.

450
00:21:56,726 --> 00:21:58,660
Qancha?

451
00:21:58,683 --> 00:22:01,097
1000 yen.

452
00:22:01,121 --> 00:22:03,454
Naqd pulda toʻlaysizmi?

453
00:22:03,477 --> 00:22:07,013
Ha, naqd pulda toʻlayman.

454
00:22:07,037 --> 00:22:09,437
1000 yen olamiz.

455
00:22:09,460 --> 00:22:11,526
Chek.

456
00:22:11,549 --> 00:22:14,216
Chekni oldim.

457
00:22:14,239 --> 00:22:17,520
