693
00:34:11,080 --> 00:34:15,213
Bugun ishlatadigan spreyni alohida toʻlash kerakmi?

694
00:34:15,236 --> 00:34:20,125
Ha, bugun ishlatadigan narsalarni oddiy kassada toʻlang.

695
00:34:20,149 --> 00:34:23,483
Faqat bitta spreyni alohida sotib olaman.

696
00:34:23,505 --> 00:34:26,072
480 yen.

697
00:34:26,095 --> 00:34:30,554
500 yen beraman. 20 yen qaytim.

698
00:34:30,578 --> 00:34:32,461
Hozir foydalanaman.

699
00:34:32,484 --> 00:34:35,339
Issiqdan saqlaning.

700
00:34:35,362 --> 00:34:36,862
16-SAHNA: Yuzni tanib olish bilan aeroportda qulaylik / Yuzni aniqlash tizimi bilan aeroportda qulay sayohat

701
00:34:36,862 --> 00:34:42,629
Aeroportdagi yangi tizim haqidagi yangiliklarni koʻrdingizmi?

702
00:34:42,652 --> 00:34:45,422
Yoʻq, koʻrmadim.

703
00:34:45,446 --> 00:34:47,813
Qanday tizim?

704
00:34:47,836 --> 00:34:52,308
„Face Express“ deb nomlangan tizim.

705
00:34:52,331 --> 00:34:57,390
Pasport koʻrsatmasdan ham samolyotga chiqishingiz mumkin.

706
00:34:57,414 --> 00:35:01,293
Pasportsiz oʻtish mumkinmi?

707
00:35:01,316 --> 00:35:03,516
Ajoyib-ku!

708
00:35:03,539 --> 00:35:08,187
Avval apparatda yuzingizning suratini olishadi.

709
00:35:08,210 --> 00:35:11,744
Pasportdagi surat bilan yuzingiz mos keladi.

710
00:35:11,767 --> 00:35:17,367
Surat olingandan soʻng, yukni topshirish tezroq boʻladi.

711
00:35:17,390 --> 00:35:21,723
Pasportni chiqarmasangiz ham boʻladi, qulay, shunday emasmi?

712
00:35:21,746 --> 00:35:25,179
Navbatda turish vaqti qisqaradi.

713
00:35:25,202 --> 00:35:29,216
Tezroq darvozadan oʻtishingiz mumkin.

714
00:35:29,240 --> 00:35:32,606
Narita va Hanedada ishlatish mumkinmi?

715
00:35:32,629 --> 00:35:36,829
Ha, Narita va Hanedada ishlatishingiz mumkin.

716
00:35:36,852 --> 00:35:39,858
Har kim ishlata oladimi?

717
00:35:39,882 --> 00:35:44,449
IC pasportingiz boʻlsa, ishlatishingiz mumkin.

718
00:35:44,472 --> 00:35:48,838
Mening pasportimda IC chip bor.

719
00:35:48,861 --> 00:35:52,117
Unda ishlatishingiz mumkin.

720
00:35:52,141 --> 00:35:55,144
Yuz suratlari xavfsizmi?

721
00:35:55,167 --> 00:35:58,800
Samolyotga oʻtgandan keyin oʻchib ketadi.

722
00:35:58,823 --> 00:36:01,071
Tez oʻchib ketadimi?

723
00:36:01,095 --> 00:36:03,180
Xotirjam boʻling, yaxshi.

724
00:36:03,203 --> 00:36:05,537
Bu xavfsiz tizim.

725
00:36:05,560 --> 00:36:08,626
Darvozada faqat kameraga qarash kifoyami?

726
00:36:08,649 --> 00:36:12,516
Ha, faqat kameraga qarashingiz bilan ochiladi.

727
00:36:12,539 --> 00:36:15,907
Pasportni qidirib topishga hojat yoʻq, shundaymi?

728
00:36:15,931 --> 00:36:19,141
Yuk koʻp boʻlganda juda qulay.

729
00:36:19,164 --> 00:36:23,242
Keyingi safar vatanimga qaytganimda ishlatmoqchiman.

730
00:36:23,266 --> 00:36:27,141
Oson ekan, sinab koʻring!

731
00:36:27,165 --> 00:36:29,854
Yaqin atrofda xodimlar ham bor.

732
00:36:29,877 --> 00:36:33,611
Yangiliklar uchun rahmat.

733
00:36:33,634 --> 00:36:36,800
Ehtiyot boʻling, xayr!

734
00:36:36,823 --> 00:36:40,057
Aeroportda suratga tushib koʻrsataman.

735
00:36:40,080 --> 00:36:42,121
Kutib qolaman!

736
00:36:42,144 --> 00:36:44,011
Xayr, yo'l bo'ling!

737
00:36:44,034 --> 00:36:45,534
17-sahna: Yuzni tanish tizimidan foydalanish / Yuzni tanish tizimidan qanday foydalanish kerak

738
00:36:45,534 --> 00:36:47,534
Uzr, menga yordam kerak.

739
00:36:47,557 --> 00:36:51,157
Yuz tizimidan foydalanmoqchiman.

740
00:36:51,180 --> 00:36:52,349
Ҳа.

741
00:36:52,373 --> 00:36:55,606
Bu mashinada qilishingiz mumkin.

742
00:36:55,629 --> 00:36:59,700
Face Express tugmasini bosing.

743
00:36:59,724 --> 00:37:02,214
Tugmani bosdim.

744
00:37:02,237 --> 00:37:08,771
Ekranning oʻng tomonida ingliz tilini tanlang, soʻngra „Ha“ni bosing.

745
00:37:08,794 --> 00:37:11,081
„Ha“ni bosdim.

746
00:37:11,104 --> 00:37:15,556
Keyin pasportingizni ochib qoʻying.

747
00:37:15,580 --> 00:37:19,260
Suratli sahifani qoʻyaman.

748
00:37:19,283 --> 00:37:21,759
Pit deb oʻqildi.

749
00:37:21,783 --> 00:37:25,949
Ism va raqam chiqdi.

750
00:37:25,972 --> 00:37:28,510
Tasdiqlash tugmasini bosing.

751
00:37:28,534 --> 00:37:31,134
Tasdiqlash tugmasini bosdim.

752
00:37:31,157 --> 00:37:34,690
Keyin kameraga qarang.

753
00:37:34,713 --> 00:37:38,580
Shlyapa va niqobni yechaman.

754
00:37:38,603 --> 00:37:42,648
Ha, shlyapa va niqobni yeching.

755
00:37:42,671 --> 00:37:46,129
Kameraga toʻgʻri qarayman.

756
00:37:46,153 --> 00:37:49,319
Mashina suratga oladi.

757
00:37:49,342 --> 00:37:50,789
Ҳа.

758
00:37:50,813 --> 00:37:54,379
Pasha degan ovoz chiqdi.

759
00:37:54,402 --> 00:37:56,887
Yuz suratini olish tugadi.

760
00:37:56,911 --> 00:38:00,152
Bu hammasi mi?

761
00:38:00,176 --> 00:38:01,822
Ҳа.

762
00:38:01,846 --> 00:38:04,379
Chipta chiqadi.

763
00:38:04,402 --> 00:38:06,569
Chipta chiqdi.

764
00:38:06,592 --> 00:38:10,759
Face Express belgisi bor.

765
00:38:10,782 --> 00:38:13,515
Koʻk belgi bor.

766
00:38:13,538 --> 00:38:18,572
Bu bilan yuk tekshiruvi ham faqat yuz orqali oʻtishingiz mumkin.

767
00:38:18,596 --> 00:38:23,529
Pasportni chiqarmasangiz ham boʻladi, qulay, shunday emasmi?

768
00:38:23,552 --> 00:38:27,485
Yukni mashinada ham joylashtirish mumkinmi?

769
00:38:27,508 --> 00:38:28,927
Ҳа.

770
00:38:28,951 --> 00:38:32,963
Ana u mashinada joylashtirishingiz mumkin.

771
00:38:32,986 --> 00:38:35,720
Yukni saqlashga boraman.

772
00:38:35,743 --> 00:38:37,623
Oson edi.

773
00:38:37,647 --> 00:38:39,144
Раҳмат.

774
00:38:39,167 --> 00:38:41,767
Yaxshi sayohat tilayman!

775
00:38:41,790 --> 00:38:43,957
Xayr, yaxshi boring!

776
00:38:43,980 --> 00:38:45,480
18-Sahna: Yukni o‘zingiz joylashtirish / Yukni o‘zingiz qanday saqlashingiz mumkin

777
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:47,446
Uzr, menga yordam kerak.

778
00:38:47,469 --> 00:38:51,755
Yukni o‘zim joylashtirishim mumkinmi?

779
00:38:51,779 --> 00:38:52,913
Ҳа.

780
00:38:52,936 --> 00:38:55,869
Bu mashinaga boring.

781
00:38:55,892 --> 00:38:59,460
O‘zim joylashtirishni birinchi marta qilmoqdaman.

782
00:38:59,484 --> 00:39:01,951
Boshlash tugmasini bosing.

783
00:39:01,975 --> 00:39:04,341
Boshlash tugmasini bosdim.

784
00:39:04,364 --> 00:39:07,164
Yuqoridagi kameraga qarang.

785
00:39:07,187 --> 00:39:11,164
Yuz suratimni oldim.

786
00:39:11,188 --> 00:39:15,121
Kameraga qarasangiz, yuzingizni aniqlaydi.

787
00:39:15,144 --> 00:39:17,724
Ekraningizda ism chiqdi.

788
00:39:17,747 --> 00:39:20,759
Yukni mashinaga qo‘ying.

789
00:39:20,782 --> 00:39:23,449
O‘rtasiga qo‘yaman.

790
00:39:23,472 --> 00:39:24,872
Ҳа.

791
00:39:24,895 --> 00:39:27,497
Yon tomonga qo‘ying.

792
00:39:27,520 --> 00:39:29,753
Og‘irligi chiqdi.

793
00:39:29,776 --> 00:39:32,230
O‘n sakkiz kilo.

794
00:39:32,254 --> 00:39:34,029
Yaxshimi?

795
00:39:34,053 --> 00:39:38,391
Yigirma uch kilogacha ruxsat beriladi, demak, muammo yo‘q.

796
00:39:38,415 --> 00:39:40,415
Juda ham xotirjam boʻldim.

797
00:39:40,438 --> 00:39:43,320
Xavfli narsalar yo‘qmi?

798
00:39:43,343 --> 00:39:46,786
Noutbuk yoki batareyalar bormi?

799
00:39:46,810 --> 00:39:49,843
Batareyalar ryukzakda.

800
00:39:49,866 --> 00:39:53,550
Batareyalarni mashinada saqlash mumkin emas.

801
00:39:53,574 --> 00:39:55,418
Тушunarлим.

802
00:39:55,441 --> 00:39:57,730
O‘zim olib yuraman.

803
00:39:57,754 --> 00:40:00,987
Endi, ha tugmasini bosing.

804
00:40:01,010 --> 00:40:03,943
Uzun yorliq chiqadi.

805
00:40:03,966 --> 00:40:05,843
Yorliq chiqdi.

806
00:40:05,867 --> 00:40:09,733
Yorliqni yukingizning dastasiga yopishtiring.

807
00:40:09,756 --> 00:40:12,290
Dastaga yopishtiraman.

808
00:40:12,313 --> 00:40:14,768
Chiroyli yopishtirdingiz.

809
00:40:14,791 --> 00:40:17,078
Keyin nima qilaman?

810
00:40:17,101 --> 00:40:19,901
Tugatish tugmasini bosing.

811
00:40:19,924 --> 00:40:22,724
Tugatish tugmasini bosdim.

812
00:40:22,747 --> 00:40:25,814
Yuk ichkariga kiradi.

813
00:40:25,837 --> 00:40:28,104
Yuk ichkariga kirdi.

814
00:40:28,126 --> 00:40:30,335
Chek chiqadi.

815
00:40:30,359 --> 00:40:32,492
Qog‘ozni oldim.

816
00:40:32,515 --> 00:40:35,163
Ehtiyotkorlik bilan saqlang, iltimos.

817
00:40:35,187 --> 00:40:38,154
Pasport qutisiga solaman.

818
00:40:38,177 --> 00:40:40,344
Bir daqiqada tugadi.

819
00:40:40,367 --> 00:40:44,137
Keyin yuk tekshiruviga boring.

820
00:40:44,160 --> 00:40:45,649
Раҳмат.

821
00:40:45,673 --> 00:41:05,939
Xayr, yo'lga chiqing.

822
00:41:05,962 --> 00:41:07,462
19-Sahna: Yuzni tanish tartibi / Yuzni tanish jarayoni

823
00:41:07,462 --> 00:41:09,229
Uzr, menga yordam kerak.

824
00:41:09,252 --> 00:41:12,252
Yuk tekshiruvi shu yerda bo‘ladimi?

825
00:41:12,275 --> 00:41:15,343
Ha, shu yerda.

826
00:41:15,367 --> 00:41:18,501
Yuz suratimni oldim.

827
00:41:18,524 --> 00:41:21,957
Unda, o‘ng tomonga boring.

828
00:41:21,980 --> 00:41:24,247
O‘ng tomonga boraman.

829
00:41:24,271 --> 00:41:28,604
Hech kim yo‘q, shuning uchun tez borishingiz mumkin.

830
00:41:28,627 --> 00:41:31,361
Pasportni ko‘rsatish kerakmi?

831
00:41:31,384 --> 00:41:35,317
Yo‘q, faqat kameraga qarang.

832
00:41:35,340 --> 00:41:38,150
Sariq joyga turing.

833
00:41:38,173 --> 00:41:41,540
Kameraga toʻgʻri qarayman.

834
00:41:41,563 --> 00:41:44,455
Endi niqob va shlyapani yechamiz.

835
00:41:44,479 --> 00:41:48,497
Ha, yuzingizni aniqladik.

836
00:41:48,520 --> 00:41:50,361
Eshik ochildi.

837
00:41:50,385 --> 00:41:52,554
Ichkariga boring.

838
00:41:52,577 --> 00:41:57,211
Pasportni chiqarmasangiz ham boʻladi, tezroq boʻladi.

839
00:41:57,234 --> 00:42:00,167
Qoʻlingizdagi narsalarni tekshiramiz.

840
00:42:00,190 --> 00:42:03,201
Yuklaringizni qutiga soling.

841
00:42:03,224 --> 00:42:05,957
Noutbuk bilan nima qilamiz?

842
00:42:05,980 --> 00:42:09,648
Noutbukni sumkadan chiqaring.

843
00:42:09,672 --> 00:42:12,039
Ha, chiqardim.

844
00:42:12,062 --> 00:42:15,197
Ichimlik bormi?

845
00:42:15,220 --> 00:42:17,587
Suv bor.

846
00:42:17,611 --> 00:42:22,891
100 millilitrdan ortiq suv olib ketolmaysiz.

847
00:42:22,915 --> 00:42:25,166
Shu yerda tashlang.

848
00:42:25,190 --> 00:42:28,123
Iltimos, u yerda turgan axlat qutisiga tashlang.

849
00:42:28,146 --> 00:42:31,146
Qalin ustki kiyimni yeching.

850
00:42:31,169 --> 00:42:33,838
Choʻntagingizdagi pullarni ham chiqaring.

851
00:42:33,862 --> 00:42:37,157
Smartfoningizni ham qutiga solamiz.

852
00:42:37,180 --> 00:42:42,146
Ha, qalin poyabzalni ham yeching va shippak kiying.

853
00:42:42,169 --> 00:42:44,148
Тушunarлим.

854
00:42:44,172 --> 00:42:48,105
Endi bu darvozadan oʻting.

855
00:42:48,129 --> 00:42:49,729
Oʻtaman.

856
00:42:49,752 --> 00:42:53,595
Ovoz chiqmadi, demak hammasi joyida.

857
00:42:53,619 --> 00:42:56,790
Yuklaringizni oling.

858
00:42:56,813 --> 00:42:58,226
Катта раҳмат.

859
00:42:58,250 --> 00:43:00,703
Samolyotga boring.

860
00:43:00,726 --> 00:43:03,093
Xayr, yo'lga chiqing.

861
00:43:03,116 --> 00:43:04,616
20-sahna: Pasport tekshiruvi tartibi / Pasport tekshiruvi jarayoni

862
00:43:04,616 --> 00:43:06,508
Uzr, menga yordam kerak.

863
00:43:06,531 --> 00:43:09,824
Pasport tekshiruvi shu yerdami?

864
00:43:09,847 --> 00:43:12,847
Ha, shu yerda.

865
00:43:12,870 --> 00:43:16,404
Avtomatik eshikdan oʻtish mumkinmi?

866
00:43:16,427 --> 00:43:20,870
IC pasport boʻlsa, oʻtishingiz mumkin.

867
00:43:20,893 --> 00:43:23,826
Avtomatik eshikka boraman.

868
00:43:23,849 --> 00:43:26,849
Suratli sahifani oching.

869
00:43:26,872 --> 00:43:29,239
Sahifani ochdim.

870
00:43:29,262 --> 00:43:32,870
Pasportni pastga qaratib, apparatga qoʻying.

871
00:43:32,893 --> 00:43:35,260
Pasportni qoʻyaman.

872
00:43:35,283 --> 00:43:38,087
Pasport aniqlandi.

873
00:43:38,110 --> 00:43:42,943
Ekranida „Kameraga qarang“ deb chiqadi.

874
00:43:42,966 --> 00:43:44,400
Ҳа.

875
00:43:44,423 --> 00:43:48,456
Shlyapa va koʻzoynakni yeching, kameraga qarang.

876
00:43:48,479 --> 00:43:51,212
Koʻzoynakni yechib koʻrayapman.

877
00:43:51,235 --> 00:43:54,202
Yuz surati tekshirilmoqda.

878
00:43:54,225 --> 00:43:57,706
Ha, eshik ochildi.

879
00:43:57,729 --> 00:43:59,814
Shu tomonga boring.

880
00:43:59,838 --> 00:44:02,304
Pasportni olaman.

881
00:44:02,327 --> 00:44:04,861
Unutmang!

882
00:44:04,884 --> 00:44:09,050
Avtomatik eshikda muhr yoʻq ekan.

883
00:44:09,073 --> 00:44:11,724
Xotira uchun muhr istardim.

884
00:44:11,747 --> 00:44:14,844
Men sizga muhr bosib beraman.

885
00:44:14,868 --> 00:44:16,913
Bu tomonga boring.

886
00:44:16,936 --> 00:44:18,709
Ha, iltimos.

887
00:44:18,733 --> 00:44:21,899
Pasportingizga muhr bosildi.

888
00:44:21,922 --> 00:44:23,489
Раҳмат.

889
00:44:23,512 --> 00:44:26,120
Xarid qildim.

890
00:44:26,143 --> 00:44:29,479
Soliqsiz chekni ko'rsatasizmi?

891
00:44:29,503 --> 00:44:34,070
Ma'lumotlar kiritilgan, shuning uchun ko'rsatmasangiz ham bo'ladi.

892
00:44:34,093 --> 00:44:36,909
Jarayon juda oson ekan, shunday emasmi?

893
00:44:36,932 --> 00:44:40,202
Tezroq o'tib ketdik, rostdan ham!

894
00:44:40,226 --> 00:44:43,260
Samolyotga chiqish joyi nechanchi raqamda?

895
00:44:43,283 --> 00:44:46,582
Chiptangizning o'ng tomoniga qarang.

896
00:44:46,606 --> 00:44:49,385
Oltmish beshinchi raqam yozilgan.

897
00:44:49,409 --> 00:44:53,461
Chapga burilib, besh daqiqa yuring.

898
00:44:53,484 --> 00:44:56,051
Samolyotgacha hali vaqt bormi?

899
00:44:56,074 --> 00:44:58,686
Hali bir soat bor.

900
00:44:58,709 --> 00:45:01,309
Do'konda xarid qilib oling.

901
00:45:01,332 --> 00:45:03,466
Yo'l sovg'asi olib ketaman.

902
00:45:03,489 --> 00:45:06,061
Yaxshi sayohat tilayman!

903
00:45:06,084 --> 00:45:08,064
Ha, rahmat.

904
00:45:08,088 --> 00:45:10,660
Xayr, yo'lga chiqing.